<title>USA: Canton Charter Twp, Mich. won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Canton Charter Twp, Mich. won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $2.140 million of Canton Charter Twp., Mich., 1997 special assessment bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.14 percent.</p>
</text>
